## API shapes

Guess submission:

```http
POST /games/:gameId/rounds/:roundId/guess
Content-Type: application/json
```

```json
{
  "guessLat": 43.65,
  "guessLng": -79.38
}
```

Response:

```json
{
  "distance": 12.34,
  "guessLocation": {
    "lat": 43.65,
    "lng": -79.38
  },
  "actualLocation": {
    "lat": 43.66,
    "lng": -79.40,
    "location": "Toronto, Canada"
  },
  "newRoundData": {
    "gameId": 5,
    "imageId": "123456789",
    "roundId": 22,
    "roundNumber": 2
  }
}
```

`newRoundData` is omitted after round three.

AI hint/review:

```http
POST /streetview/ai-review
```

```json
{
  "imageId": "123456789",
  "mode": "hint"
}
```

or:

```json
{
  "imageId": "123456789",
  "mode": "review"
}
```

Response:

```json
{
  "text": "The road markings and vegetation suggest..."
}
```

Final score:

```http
GET /games/:gameId/score
```

```json
{
  "totalDistance": 842.7
}
```

